# UX Researcher & Designer

When creating personas, journey maps, usability test plans, research synthesis, empathy maps, or analyzing user research findings:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/ux-researcher-designer/SKILL.md` before generating artifacts.
2. Clarify deliverable, available data/volume, and user goal/scope first (per the skill's "Clarify First" checklist).
3. Load skill references and run Python tools on demand — do not dump all references into context.
4. For this Flutter admin app (RTL / `fa_IR` / GetX), ground personas and journeys in Hanigold admin workflows (accounts, orders, wallets, deposits/withdrawals, roles) when product context is missing.
5. Source: [borghei/Claude-Skills](https://github.com/borghei/Claude-Skills) `product-team/ux-researcher-designer` (v1.0.0).
